        "heading_raw": null,
        "body_raw": "This spell imbues a single creature with great bravery and morale in battle. The target gains a +2 morale bonus on attack rolls, saves, and skill checks.\nHeroism, Greater\n\nSchool enchantment (compulsion) [mind-affecting]; Level bard 5, psychic 6, sorcerer/wizard 6, spiritualist 6, summoner 5, unchained summoner 6, witch 6; Subdomain heroism 6; Mystery ancestor 6, succor 6"
